{"id":"wb-6-702","name":"鹫峰寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"蓬溪白塔","text":"鹫峰寺塔，又称蓬溪白塔，位于四川省遂宁市蓬溪县赤城镇，文物遗址年代判定为宋。2002年12月27日公布为四川省第六批省级文物保护单位。2006年5月25日列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%93%AC%E6%BA%AA%E7%99%BD%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86458638,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86458638","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7110b82ca975e1fff64fe66c.jpg","title":"鹫峰寺塔照片.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%B9%AB%E5%B3%B0%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/67/%E9%B9%AB%E5%B3%B0%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Jiufeng temple pagoda","width":320,"height":347}}